      "content": "That makes sense, but I'm worried a discount might just annoy them more if they're already fuming. \n\nIf we decide to go with a replacement or a direct refund to close the case fast, can we justify it internally as a \"carrier error\" so we don't have to flag this customer for potential fraud or look like we're just eating costs for no reason? I need to be able to explain why we're approving this despite what the sensor logs show.",
